results/

# ...but these CSVs ARE the deliverable, not scratch. The blanket *.csv
# above silently dropped them from `git add <dir>`: the commit succeeded,
# the file 404'd on GitHub. Keep any new data table listed here.
!research/challenge-tickers/*.csv
!research/megaday-study/data/*.csv
!research/trade-journal/*.csv
!research/trade-log/*.csv
# The first-pullback edge study: its tables ARE the deliverable (brief sect.
# 30 asks for them by name). The 121MB bar cache under data/cache/ is NOT —
# it is regenerable from the provider and is excluded below.
!research/first-pullback-edge/data/*.csv
!research/first-pullback-edge/data/*.parquet
!research/first-pullback-edge/results/
!research/first-pullback-edge/results/*.csv
research/first-pullback-edge/data/cache/
research/first-pullback-edge/data/symbol_pool.json

